 "message": "Hi Emily, I haven't started offboarding for Victor Huang (E038). Offboarding is for voluntary departures (resignation or contract end), and POL-OFF-02 says a leave of absence, including parental leave, is not an offboarding. Access stays on during a leave and HR handles it. I've passed your request to the HR team with the details: leave starting 2026-12-01, return date to be confirmed. They'll follow up with you on the leave and on any access changes.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
